      "id": 1,
      "text": "Burnham is a village located in Cook County, Illinois.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnham%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "It borders Chicago to the north, Calumet City to the south and west, and Hammond, Indiana to the east.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnham%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The village is divided into two sections: a western part around Torrence Avenue and an eastern part around Burnham Avenue.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnham%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Torrence Avenue crosses a bridge into Chicago, while Burnham Avenue becomes Avenue O once it enters the city.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnham%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Because of its small size, Burnham has long been a focal point for annexation debates, with some arguing it would be cheaper to join Chicago.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnham%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Pace operates several bus routes that link Burnham to other destinations across the Southland.",
